  exe_cli_errors_source.pcpp - Build-kind compliance: a source file that does not exist

  A source file that does not exist: exit 2, its full path named (<DIR> =
  res\tests as the compiler spells it).

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\exe_cli_missing.pcpp
  EXPECT:
    PaskalCPP™ CLI v<VERSION>
    Copyright © 2026-present tinyBigGAMES™ LLC, All Rights Reserved.
    https://paskalcpp.org

    Error: Source file not found: <DIR>/exe_cli_missing.pcpp
  EXITCODE: 2
  <VERSION> is the compiler's version (the banner's one changing text); the
  tester runs pcpp.exe itself (cmCli), once: the CLI is the same for every
  target. This file is not compiled.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe exe_cli_errors_source;

